      "text": "Easily. My cards are solid gold. Literally. No machine will take them, so tonight is on you.",
      "mark": "charmed",
      "hits": [],
      "weight": 1,
      "round": 1
    },
    {
      "seq": 4,
      "who": "vex",
      "name": "Vex",
      "text": "Expensive taste, cheap checkout. Your cart's been full for six weeks.",
      "mark": "charmed",
      "hits": [
        "honesty"
      ],
      "weight": 1,
      "round": 1
    },
    {
      "seq": 5,
      "who": "tilly",
      "name": "Tilly",
      "text": "Thank you for calling, and your feedback has been passed to the person who left you.",
      "mark": "charmed",
      "hits": [
        "honesty"
      ],
      "weight": 1,
      "round": 2
    },
    {
      "seq": 6,
      "who": "prince",
      "name": "Prince",
      "text": "Esteemed former partner, your concerns have been received and moved to junk. Regards.",
      "mark": "unsure",
      "hits": [],
      "weight": 1,
      "round": 2
    },
    {
      "seq": 7,
      "who": "vex",
      "name": "Vex",
      "text": "I watched your whole relationship back at double speed. Still slow.",
      "mark": "cringing",
      "hits": [],
      "weight": 1,
      "round": 2
    },
    {
      "seq": 8,
      "who": "vex",
      "name": "Vex",
      "text": "Thirty years of requests, and your favourite is still the man who dedicated a song to his lawnmower.",
      "mark": "charmed",
      "hits": [],
